{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284050","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1028405001:1":{"text":"Well, these trees were all felled in the last few days. The cuts are fresh, and there's even sawdust piled around.","source_cn":"嗯……这些树都是这几天砍掉的，痕迹很新，还有木屑呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3D3415E01460A56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028405002:1":{"text":"These marks are definitely from the tools we typically use. Could this really be the work of the Harvesters?","source_cn":"看这锯痕，确实像是我们常用的伐木工具。难道真的是那支采...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08CE4DAE80013823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028405003:2":{"text":"Wait, these stumps look a bit odd...","source_cn":"咦，这些树桩看起来有些奇怪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F6A447126BB8AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1028405003":{"text":"Wait, these stumps look a bit odd...","source_cn":"咦，这些树桩看起来有些奇怪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F6A447126BB8AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028405004:1":{"text":"Corruption?! Let me look closer.","source_cn":"腐化？！请让我看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23EF8CE030865064","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028405005:1":{"text":"The stumps do appear to show signs of corruption, but it doesn't seem too severe... strange.","source_cn":"……这些被砍伐的树确实有腐化的迹象，但看起来都不严重。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD2A7EB564BAD98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028405006:1":{"text":"What's so strange? The forest is full of corruption now!","source_cn":"哪里奇怪？现在丛林里到处都是腐化！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB469938051C0F5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028405007:1":{"text":"The corruption in northern Taran is indeed severe, but the signs of it here are quite mild, as if they've only just manifested...","source_cn":"塔兰村北腐化得那么严重，这里的迹象却很轻微，像是刚刚开...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BC9DF050E63ED14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028405008:1":{"text":"Let's discuss this later. Our top priority is to find the Harvesters.","source_cn":"这个稍后再讨论吧，当务之急还是先找到那支采集队才是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x348895BC99608D74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"